error[L0520]: the result of `sizer` keeps a borrow of a temporary
 --> check/returned_closure_keeps_temporary_vector.knv:4:21
  |
1 | (defn sizer (items) (fn () (len items)))
  |              ----- the returned closure keeps this borrow of `items`
...
4 |   (let (size (sizer (vec 1 2 3)))
  |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^ this temporary is dropped at the end of the statement
  |
  = help: bind the argument with `let` before the statement that binds the result, so it lives as long as the result
  = note: run `knave doc L0520` for an explanation
